From 93f0a3d4919d109b726a2667dc7085494aa26908 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:46:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Views on the variables of a state view, extraction

- getGradientView, getThermodynamicForceView and
  getInternalStateVariableView on a MaterialStateView, as on a material
  state manager.
- extractInternalStateVariable on a MaterialStateView, with the given
  operations: the extraction also works on a device.
- the extraction of a material state manager in a view checks the output
  as the field operations (distinct values).
---
 include/MGIS/Behaviour/MaterialDataView.hxx | 37 +++++++++
 src/MaterialDataView.cxx                    | 59 +++++++++++++++
 src/MaterialStateManager.cxx                |  7 +-
 tests/MaterialDataViewTest.cxx              | 84 +++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 182 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

